        "semanticLevel": "summary",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "renderShape": {
          "kind": "markdown"
        },
        "markdown": "# Lionel Argument Audit Study 04\n\n## Thesis-Led Adversarial Media Audit\n\nA roughly **1:40:44** Lionel episode using selected Joe Rogan and Andy Wilson excerpts as evidence inside Lionel's own larger argument.\n\n**1 reversal thesis**  \n**1 sponsor break**  \n**at least 2 clearly marked source excerpts**  \n**pause, replay, diagnosis, and reconstructed answers**\n\n`FRAME FAILURE -> DEFINE STANDARD -> PLAY EXHIBIT -> STOP -> DIAGNOSE -> REPLAY -> RECONSTRUCT -> RETURN TO EVIDENCE`\n\nThe source media is an exhibit. Lionel's thesis remains the spine.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786055142666,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
