        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-argument-audit-study-04"
        },
        "markdown": "# 📺 Source and Attribution Boundary\n\n**Duration represented:** approximately 1:40:44.\n\n**Primary external media:** excerpts from a Joe Rogan conversation featuring Andy Wilson.\n\nLionel introduces the conversation as an attempted attack on Candace Owens that, in his view, produced the opposite result. He promises both an overview and a tutorial in why the exchange failed as debate. \n\nThe transcript does not provide reliable speaker labels. Playback boundaries are inferred from Lionel's commands such as `watch this`, `stop right there`, `hear this again`, and `now let's watch this`.\n\nClaims about people, organizations, evidence, motives, and responsibility in this graph remain explicitly attributed to the speakers. They are not presented as independently verified findings.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786055142666,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
