        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-argument-audit-study-04"
        },
        "markdown": "# 🧭 Central Observation\n\nThis is **not** another pure annotated media reaction.\n\nIn Study 03, the source clip supplied the episode's timeline. Here Lionel spends roughly eighteen minutes defining his thesis, opponent, standards, and strategic interpretation before playing the first excerpt. \n\nThe Joe Rogan material functions as a set of **exhibits** inside Lionel's argument. He chooses passages, stops them, diagnoses what he believes went wrong, replays statements, proposes better answers, and then returns to evidence the source allegedly ignored.\n\n**Working composition label:** `Thesis-Led Adversarial Media Audit`.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786055142666,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
    {
