        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-argument-audit-study-04"
        },
        "markdown": "# 1 · Reversal Thesis and Promise\n## 0:00–4:15\n\nLionel opens with a reversal: an appearance apparently intended to discredit Candace Owens instead strengthened interest in her cause. He distinguishes attacking Candace's credibility from actually defending the official narrative and promises a debate tutorial based on the failure. \n\n**Function:** state the conclusion first, define the evaluative question, and promise that the media excerpts will demonstrate it.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786055142666,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
