        },
        "markdown": "# 2 · Sponsor Break\n## 4:15–5:32\n\nAfter the hook and promise, Lionel inserts a Noble Gold Investments advertisement with a phone number, offer, election framing, and investment-risk disclaimer. \n\n**Function:** monetize after curiosity has been established but before the main analysis begins.\n\nThis is the first specimen in the study set with a clearly separable **Sponsor Break**.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
