        "markdown": "# 4 · First Exhibit and Immediate Stop\n## 18:19–25:16\n\nLionel starts a Joe Rogan excerpt concerning whether another actor could have killed Charlie Kirk and whether Israel could be considered. He pauses almost immediately after Andy Wilson begins answering, interprets the hesitation as being caught off guard, and disputes the claim that there is no supporting evidence. \n\nHe later asks the audience to hear a statement again, showing that the same source range may be replayed rather than consumed once. \n\n**Function:** introduce a source statement as an exhibit, freeze it, and begin adversarial inspection.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786055142666,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
