        "markdown": "# 6 · Return to the Evidence Record\n## 35:16–44:48\n\nLionel leaves the source clip for a long evidence audit covering alleged confessions, timing, phone custody, immunity, message deletion, authentication, images, DNA mixtures, and other disputed circumstances. His point is that the media discussion attacks skepticism without addressing the concrete issues that created skepticism. \n\nHe then distinguishes an alternative microphone hypothesis from an official defense position and warns against confusing questions, hypotheses, and accusations. \n\n**Function:** use the source's omissions as a bridge back into Lionel's own forensic material.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786055142666,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
