        "markdown": "# 7 · Second Exhibit and Technical Correction\n## 44:48–52:16\n\nA second clearly marked playback passage addresses the microphone theory. Lionel interrupts to distinguish an exploding pager from a shaped or directed charge and insists that even a rejected hypothesis must first be represented accurately. \n\nHe then pivots from the disputed mechanism to missing physical evidence, asking about the shirt, autopsy, wound examination, and connection to the rifle. \n\n**Function:** correct the source's formulation, narrow the actual claim, and redirect attention to what could resolve it.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
