        },
        "markdown": "# 12 · Reflective Audience Close\n## 1:37:26–1:40:44\n\nLionel asks whether the long discussion made viewers more informed, more confused, or more convinced. He identifies the unresolved `why` as the question that continues to trouble him and makes one final juror-oriented recap. \n\nHe thanks viewers and super-chat contributors, requests subscriptions, likes, notifications, and continued support, mentions possible later programming, and closes with a community promise to continue investigating. \n\n**Function:** transform the audience from passive viewers into reflective participants and ongoing members of the inquiry.",
