      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-argument-audit-study-04"
        },
        "markdown": "# 🏗️ Updated Lionel Package Model\n\n## Shared primitives\nVideo Source, Timed Segment, Transcript Segment, Embedded Source, Person, Organization, Claim, Evidence Item, Hypothesis, Uncertainty, Playback Transition.\n\n## Shared Lionel moves\nStates Thesis, Defines System, Identifies Pattern, Adds Analogy, Audits Evidence, Reenacts Proof Test, Adds Context, Qualifies Theory, Builds Rapport, Directs Audience.\n\n## Media-oriented moves\nFrames Media, Comments on Media, Replays Media, Summarizes Media, Audits Argument, Reconstructs Answer.\n\n## Production/container nodes\nSponsor Break, Host Introduction, Host Redirect, Guest Signoff, Live Audience Acknowledgment, Programming Announcement, Channel Outro.\n\n## Composition templates now observed\n- Lionel Thesis Monologue\n- Hosted Forensic Commentary\n- Annotated Media Reaction\n- Thesis-Led Adversarial Media Audit\n\nThe package increasingly resembles a **grammar library with multiple composition templates**, not a single show template.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786055142666,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lionel-study04-confidence",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "Confidence and Next Test",
      "root": false,
      "position": {
        "x": 320,
        "y": 1160
      },
      "width": 700,
      "height": 540,
      "ports": [
